Date:
Jul 21, 2019

Training Parameters:
Upscale factor 4
Batch Size 4
Test Batch Size 4
nEpochs 30
Learning Rate 0.001
CUDA enabled

Training Data:
12 min Witcher 3 no HUD gameplay footage, 1080p (22067 images)
(originally 60fps but captured at 30fps so maybe some artifacts)

Testing Data:
5 min Witcher 3 no HUD gameplay footage, 1080p (10453 images)
(originally 60fps but captured at 30fps so maybe some artifacts)

Neural Network Structure:
Default network structure of 4 layers

Notes:
Training performance peaked in the 2nd epoch, this is why training terminated early in the 11th epoch
Seems like our NN isn't capable of holding enough information, may need to add additional layers
